# --- Privacy / sensitive content ---
# Do not commit raw source material, personal reflections, or sensitive operational documents.
# Even if the repo is private today, GitHub history is permanent. Keep these out entirely.

# Audio source files (personal voice memos)
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.wav
*.aac
*.flac

# Audio transcripts (candid commentary about real people)
**/transcripts/

# Office documents (bio, retainer, operating agreements, letterhead, research, press PDFs)
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.odt
*.rtf

# Screenshots (may contain DNS records, account info, or other sensitive setup data)
**/DNS Records Screenshot*.png
**/*screenshot*.png

# Scratch / build / preview files
**/palette-preview*.html
**/transcribe.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# --- System & editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# --- OneDrive sync metadata ---
*.lnk
~$*

# --- Node / build artifacts (if Squarespace ever needs build tooling locally) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
